   "sec": 20.32,
   "heard": "UPSC, twenty seventeen. General Studies Paper One, fifteen marks, two fifty words. What characteristics can be assigned to the monsoon climate? It feeds more than fifty per cent of the world's people in Monsoon Asia. Here's the catch. About half of humanity is easy to prove. More than half is not."
